Package: mujterm
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Viktor Nemcok
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-vte-2.91, tmux, git, openssh-client
Description: Project-oriented terminal with coding-agent status
 MujTerm is a native GTK/VTE terminal that groups persistent tmux sessions by
 project and shows live Codex and Claude Code status in its sidebar.
